{
    "background_story": "In the heart of the enchanted forest, there lived a beaver named Charming. He was renowned for his exceptional skills in woodworking, particularly with the pitsaw, a tool he used to precision-cut logs for his intricate dam constructions. Charming's creations were so remarkable that the other woodland creatures would often gather to marvel at his handiwork. One day, a harsh storm threatened to destroy the forest, and the animals turned to Charming for help. With his trusty pitsaw, he worked tirelessly to reinforce the dams and protect their homes. Thanks to Charming's ingenuity and mastery of the pitsaw, the forest was saved, and he was hailed as a hero by his fellow creatures.",
